# CareKin — no environment variables are needed for the current build.
#
# apps/web is a frontend-only prototype: all data lives in the browser's
# localStorage (seeded automatically on first load), auth/payments are
# simulated. `pnpm install && pnpm --filter @carekin/web dev` is the whole
# setup.
#
# When the Supabase-backed build is wired up, the expected variables are:
#
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
#   SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=        # server-side only, never NEXT_PUBLIC_
#
# For apps/mobile (paused), the API base URL:
#   EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=              # your machine's LAN IP for device testing
